{"id":"vod_sn_39139","vodId":"39139","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恋风","name_cn":"恋风","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5074ae086e8b51e66e89dc2e6f78ed3b.jpg"},"summary":"佐伯耕四郎（三宅健太 配音）有一个名叫小日向七夏（中村有岐 配音）的妹妹。因为幼年时兄妹两人的父母离婚，耕四郎和七夏就此分离，自此再也没有见过面。随着时间的推移，关于妹妹的回忆渐渐暗淡。　　成年之后的耕四郎开始在婚姻介绍所上班，虽然做着牵红线的工作，但耕四郎自己的感情道路却并不顺畅。七夏考上了耕四郎所在的城市的高中，这也就意味着，耕四郎和七夏又要开始住在同一屋檐下的生活了。心里怀着喜悦、愧疚、担忧，怀着极其复杂的心情，耕四郎和七夏重逢了。家里突然多出了一个人，给耕四郎的生活带来了不少的麻烦，但随着时间的推移，耕四郎内心里对于七夏的感情复苏了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:39","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JMnur7abYG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JUWyidDJpg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sxEsu1dCU71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wn9Nt189f81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/RAr1eLyJJu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/cq7yVK17BY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hX87jn59LK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZPYLiV8ymP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EyAEXtdr6V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/A5nTiurbyZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NTBeBYAuxv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/x7ejX2AhEx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yQyHrn390E1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.080Z"}